nd compare styles before they hit my feed. The product cards make it easy to spot what is worth saving.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Kim, High School Student</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">GenPark makes shopping feel social. I can save cute finds, send them to friends, and discover products that feel more personal than big-box search.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Jack, Robotics Club Lead</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I come here for gadgets, desk gear, and AI tools. The summaries help me understand what a product is good for without opening ten tabs.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  max-w-full flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><p style=\"color:#212427\" class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Sophie, TikTok Creator</p><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-full text-xl\">GenPark is where I look for products that feel aesthetic but still useful. It helps me turn finds into content ideas faster.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Ryan, AI Builder</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I like that GenPark explains why something fits. For keyboards, monitors, and AI apps, it feels more like research than scrolling.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Ava, Social Media Intern</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">The platform is a goldmine for discovering brands before they blow up. It keeps my saved folders fresh and my social feed ahead of trends.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Liam, Gamer</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I use GenPark for setup upgrades, headphones, and weirdly cool accessories. The AI recs understand the vibe I&#x27;m going for.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Mia, Mobile Photographer</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">The curated selection is perfect for shoots, dorm corners, and everyday carry. I find products that look good on camera and still work in real life.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Marcus, Campus Founder</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">The conversational agent feels like a sharp friend who already knows my budget and style. It helps me move from idea to shortlist fast.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Chloe, Design Student</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I love the minimal aesthetic of GenPark AI. Exploring gadgets, creator tools, and lifestyle products feels polished instead of overwhelming.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"self-right mt-10 flex w-full max-w-[3000px] animate-infinite-scroll items-start justify-between gap-5 px-5 max-md:max-w-full max-md:flex-wrap  max-md:justify-center\"><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Ava, Digital Artist</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">My experience here feels less like shopping and more like collecting inspiration. I find pieces that match my style, room, and online identity.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex   flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">John, Streetwear Stylist</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">GenPark helps me discover brands that still feel early. The AI-styled product posts make each item easier to imagine in a real outfit.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Jessica, Club Organizer</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I can find gifts, event supplies, and group favorites without starting from scratch. GenPark turns vague ideas into real options quickly.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Lucy, CS Student</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I appreciate the AI-generated summaries because they save me from review fatigue. I can share finds with friends and decide faster.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Linda, Data Science Major</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">The recommendations feel surprisingly specific. GenPark notices when I care about price, aesthetics, reviews, and whether something is actually useful.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Ethan, College Athlete</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I love how GenPark introduces brands that balance performance and style. I can compare gear for practice, recovery, and travel in one place.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex   flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Chloe, Fashion Blogger</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">GenPark is my secret weapon for finding trendy, affordable pieces that stand out. The community vibe makes discovery feel alive.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Noah, Student Founder</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">GenPark doesn&#x27;t just surface products; it gives me brand and content ideas. I&#x27;ve even found partners I wanted to contact for collaborations.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Ella, Bedroom Producer</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">From headphones to creator accessories, GenPark helps me level up my setup without looking like everyone else on my For You page.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Zoe, Climate Club Member</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I love finding brands with a clearer story around materials, packaging, and purpose. GenPark makes conscious discovery easier.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Elena, Newsletter Writer</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">Finally a platform that respects my taste and doesn&#x27;t spam me with irrelevant ads. The discovery feed gives me better story angles.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Lucas, Setup Enthusiast</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">Finding clean desk setup items, lights, and smart accessories has never been this inspiring. GenPark understands the whole vibe.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Nina, Beauty Reviewer</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I use GenPark to compare skincare tools, beauty gadgets, and viral products before I buy. The summaries make the hype easier to judge.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Kai, AI-Native Shopper</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I don&#x27;t want endless search results. I want a smart shortlist with context, price awareness, and a reason why each product fits me.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Maya, Gift Hunter</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">GenPark is perfect when I need gifts that feel personal. It helps me find products that match someone&#x27;s aesthetic, hobbies, and budget.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex  flex-col items-start self-stretch rounded-[30px] border border-white/30 bg-white/40 px-5 py-8 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md max-md:max-w-full\"><div class=\"flex w-[520px] max-w-full flex-col items-start self-center\"><h2 style=\"color:#212427\" class=\" text-2xl font-semibold\">Jayden, Trend Spotter</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-xl max-md:max-w-full\">I like finding brands before everyone else is talking about them. GenPark makes new product discovery feel fast, visual, and shareable.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section style=\"justify-content:space-around\" class=\"about-sec hidden w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden px-8 md:col-span-2 md:flex md:h-[100svh] md:min-h-[760px]\"><div style=\"justify-self:center\" class=\"flex w-full max-w-[704px] flex-col place-content-center justify-self-stretch pl-4 md:pl-20\"><div style=\"color:#8908B6;font-size:48px\" class=\"-mr-5 whitespace-nowrap  text-5xl font-semibold max-md:max-w-full max-md:text-4xl\">About<!-- --> <p class=\"-mr-5 inline-block  whitespace-nowrap bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FDA7FF] via-[#5C62ED] to-[#8908B6]  bg-clip-text text-5xl font-semibold text-transparent max-md:max-w-full max-md:text-4xl \">GenPark</p> </div><p style=\"font-size:24px\" 